  "worked_solution": "The right Riemann sum overestimates the area under the respective curve if the function is increasing over the given interval. \n\nOf the given options, the only function that is increasing over $x\\in [-3,-1]$ is as follows.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14222967/assets/4d4e96c9dc96dcfc8ef6c2fe984a915ff047531ce33706dd781a9d159ca82950.png)",
